          Have a problem worth <span class="serif text-acid">taking apart?</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <a href="mailto:t.high1945@gmail.com" class="btn btn-primary">
        t.high1945@gmail.com <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 pt-12">
      <div>
        <p class="font-display font-semibold text-lg tracking-tight">Tanishk Tiwari</p>
